   ],
   "html": "<p>Universal sought a wildly outlandish idea worthy of this R-rated dog comedy to excite audiences and drive them to theaters. </p>\n<p>Enter the Strays Ice Cream Truck, simultaneously hitting the streets of NYC and LA ahead of opening weekend. Armed with their own \"Poop Patrol,\" these trucks served “poop” and “pee” ice cream treats outside of local dog parks for both humans and dogs. </p>\n<p>To help spread the word, we created branded assets to share on social media and sent out a dedicated newsletter to the wider IHC community. </p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "ice cream truck",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Branded trucks made surprise stops at dog parks on both coasts, offering ice cream, branded swag, and potty-mouth laughs. Humans could choose between <strong>Poop Fairy Cup </strong>(Chocolate Gelato) or  <strong>Pee Because You Own It </strong>(Lemon Italian Ice in NY and Shaved Ice in LA), while their pups were treated to<strong> </strong>a <strong>Stray Snack </strong>(dog bone in custard from Shake Shack). </p>"
    },
