  {
   "title": "POOP PATROL",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Our Poop Patrol squad accompanied each truck stop, collecting the droppings of man's best friend, all recorded as prank video content. Led by comedians with improv prowess, the team stormed dog parks, unleashing irreverent antics and candid on-the-street interviews on unsuspecting passersby. </p>"
